            <ArticleTitle>[Use of blue-green micro-seaweed Spirulina platensis for the correction of lipid and hemostatic disturbances in patients with ischemic heart disease].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>28-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Changing in lipid spectrum, immunological state and coagulation in the 68 patients with IHD and atherogenic dyslipidemia who were taking biomass microalga Spirulina platensis was investigated. Modification of traditional plan of therapy of IHD when adding microalga Spirulina p. influences correcting effect to cascade procoagulation and immunopathological reactions, characteristic of atherosclerosis process.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
